        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Karan Kapoor, Geoffrey Kendal, Laura Kendal\n- Organizations: Shakespeareana\n- Places: India, Asia\n- Topics: theatre touring, Shakespeare performances, Shaw performances\n\nFacts:\n- Geoffrey Kendal was born on 7 September 1909 and died on 14 May 1998.\n- Geoffrey Kendal was an English actor-manager.\n- In the 1940s and 1950s, Geoffrey Kendal delivered Shakespeare performances throughout India.\n- Geoffrey Kendal and Laura Kendal were the maternal grandparents of Karan Kapoor.\n- Geoffrey Kendal and Laura Kendal were actors who toured India and Asia with their theatre group Shakespeareana.\n- Shakespeareana performed works by Shakespeare and Shaw.",
